---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Accessibility | Hendrix Ventures Group"
  description="Hendrix Ventures Group's commitment to an accessible website — and how to reach us directly if anything here is hard for you to use."
  path="/accessibility"
>
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1>Accessibility</h1>
      <p>
        Selling a house is stressful enough without a website getting in the
        way. We build this site to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines
        (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA: real headings and landmarks, full keyboard
        operation, visible focus, strong color contrast, labeled forms with
        announced errors, captions and transcripts on every video, and
        respect for reduced-motion settings.
      </p>
      <p>
        If anything here is hard for you to use — with a screen reader, by
        keyboard, on a phone, in any way — please tell us and we'll fix it.
        And you never need the website at all:
        <a href="tel:+16787105786">call or text (678) 710-5786</a> or email
        <a href="mailto:hasani@hendrixventures.com"
          >hasani@hendrixventures.com</a
        >
        and we'll handle everything personally.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
